   "titulo": "Something that just happened.",
   "texto": [
    "To say that something just happened, use **venir** in present + **de** + infinitive: **Je viens de finir** (just finished).",
    "The main verb remains in infinitive: **Elle vient de rentrer**, **Nous venons de manger**.",
    "The present of **venir** is irregular; see the shapes of the table."
